  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  version: 0.9.0\n\npackage:\n  name: speculators\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://pypi.org/packages/source/s/speculators/speculators-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: ad5e21eedc89f95096d92ceeccb794df88e24394615f5e8f02957485aea3d8cf\n  patches:\n    # setup.py only treats a source tree as an sdist if the directory is named\n    # speculators-<version>, so from a rattler-build work dir it recomputes a\n    # version from git tags (which do not exist) and pins the wrong\n    # hs-connectors release.\n    - patches/0001-fix-sdist-detection.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  noarch: python\n  script:\n    content: ${{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . -vv --no-deps --no-build-isolation\n    env:\n      # setup.py derives the hs-connectors requirement from the build type and\n      # defaults to \"nightly\", which emits a range that excludes the matching\n      # release of hs-connectors and fails `pip check`.\n      SPECULATORS_BUILD_TYPE: release\n\nrequirements:\n  host:\n    - python ${{ python_min }}.*\n    - setuptools >=84.0.0\n    - setuptools-git-versioning >=2.0,<3\n    - packaging\n    - pip\n  run:\n    - python >=${{ python_min }}\n    - hs-connectors ==${{ version }}\n    - click\n    - datasets >=4.0.0,<=5.1.0\n    - huggingface_hub\n    - loguru >=0.7.2,<=0.7.3\n    - numpy >=2.0.0,<=2.5.4\n    - openai >=2.0.0\n    - protobuf\n    - psutil\n    - pydantic >=2.0.0\n    - pydantic-settings >=2.0.0\n    - rich\n    - safetensors\n    - pytorch >=2.9.0,<=2.14.1\n    - torchaudio\n    - torchvision\n    - tqdm >=4.66.3,<=4.70.1\n    - transformers >=5.0.0,<=5.19.0\n    - typer >=0.12.0\n    - httpx\n    - aiohttp\ntests:\n  - python:\n      python_version:\n        - ${{ python_min }}.*\n        - '*'\n      imports:\n        - speculators\n      pip_check: true\n\nabout:\n  summary: A unified library for creating, representing, and storing speculative decoding algorithms for LLM serving such as in vLLM.\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  homepage: https://pypi.org/project/speculators/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - xhochy\n",
